// `emit_sections.vl` — the emitter's driver and section emission: the `emitProgram` entry
// point and its ordered pass table, and the assembly of the final module bytes (header, type/
// import/function/global/export/code sections, the shared runtime helpers, the start-function
// model, per-function code emission, the opt-in name section). Sits above `wasmEmit.vl`, calling down into it for every statement/expression body.

